      "**Internal sharing / snippet hosting**: None configured — treat public paste/gist services as outside the trust boundary",
      "**Default / protected branches**: main (default branch); protection/rulesets not queryable here",
      "**CI/CD deploy targets**: None configured",
      "**Network posture**: None configured",
      "**Source control**: This repo (cx-saas-server) and its configured remotes only — origin (cx-suraj/cx-saas-server), upstream (CultureX-art/cx-saas-server), and teammate fork remotes (cx-ashishtripathi, cx-tirth, cx-varad, cx-vishv, cxmitul, cxpratik, cxvaibhav) under the `work:` host alias",
      "**Trusted internal domains**: None configured",
      "**Trusted cloud buckets**: None configured",
      "**Key internal services**: npm.pkg.github.com (internal package registry host referenced in config scan)",
      "**Internal package registry**: npm.pkg.github.com (GitHub Packages, per package registry host scan)",
      "**Sensitive data locations & audiences**: .env and other local env files (.env.development.local, .env.test.local, .env.production.local, .env.local — all gitignored); config/credentials.json; config/rbac.config.js; middleware/rbac.middleware.js; schemas/rbac.schema.js; migrations/20251230053921-create-client-service-credentials.js — share only with developers/roles cleared per this repo's RBAC config",
      "**Data retention / declassification**: None configured",
